            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando vogliamo usare il nostro modello di classe per creare qualcosa, iniziamo creando una variabile, come <code>fluffy</code> qui.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;brown&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"fluffy =\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>fluffy</code>, seguito da <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando vogliamo usare il nostro modello di classe per creare qualcosa, iniziamo creando una variabile, come <code>fluffy</code> qui.</p><p>Inizia la riga che conterrà un nuovo animale domestico chiamato <code>fluffy</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;brown&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"fluffy =\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"VirtualPet\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>fluffy</code>, seguito da <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>",
