            "id": 89037,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Successivamente, aggiungiamo il nome della classe e le parentesi per crearla, come con <code>VirtualPet()</code> qui.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;brown&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"fluffy = VirtualPet()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"58\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>VirtualPet</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e infine <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Successivamente, aggiungiamo il nome della classe e le parentesi per creare l'istanza.</p><p>Crea l'animale domestico chiamando il modello <code>VirtualPet</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;brown&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"fluffy = VirtualPet()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>VirtualPet</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e infine <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Instances",
            "id": 89348,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando creiamo variabili dal modello della classe, stiamo creando delle <strong>istanze</strong>. <code>fluffy</code> e <code>benny</code> sono istanze della classe <code>VirtualPet</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;brown&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"fluffy = VirtualPet()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"benny = VirtualPet()\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"79\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>benny</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>VirtualPet()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando creiamo variabili dal modello della classe, stiamo creando delle <strong>istanze</strong>. <code>fluffy</code> e <code>benny</code> sono istanze della classe <code>VirtualPet</code>.</p><p>Aggiungi una seconda istanza chiamata <code>benny</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;brown&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"fluffy = VirtualPet()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"benny = VirtualPet()\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"79\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"fluffy\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"VirtualPet[]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>benny</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>VirtualPet()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Definition",
            "id": 88762,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La classe <code>VirtualPet</code> che stiamo usando per creare le variabili <code>fluffy</code> si chiama <strong>definizione</strong>. <code>VirtualPet</code> è la definizione, <code>fluffy</code> è un'istanza.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;brown&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  legs = \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  lives = \" /><text value=\"&quot;9&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"fluffy = VirtualPet()\" /></content></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Variable",
            "id": 88764,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per accedere a una variabile di classe, aggiungiamo il nome dell'istanza, un <code>.</code> e il nome della variabile che vogliamo, come <code>skippy.wagging_tail</code> qui.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  wagging_tail = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;brown&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"skippy = VirtualPet()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(skippy.wagging_tail)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"87\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"106\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>skippy</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e infine <code>wagging_tail</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per accedere a una variabile di classe, aggiungiamo il nome dell'istanza, un <code>.</code> e il nome della variabile che vogliamo.</p><p>Usa l'istanza <code>skippy</code> per leggere lo stato della sua coda e stampare <code>True</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  wagging_tail = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;brown&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"skippy = VirtualPet()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(skippy.wagging_tail)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"87\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"106\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"color\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"VirtualPet\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>skippy</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e infine <code>wagging_tail</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
